        "description": "Presence of congenital anomalies including craniofacial dysmorphism and musculoskeletal abnormalities",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Genetic confirmation of the 9q33.3q34.11 microdeletion plus presence of developmental delay and at least one congenital anomaly",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies primarily on molecular genetic testing combined with clinical features."
